on_text":"texttext"}],"type":"secommerce_product"},"description":"<p>When the sun sets, the energy rises at Red Panda Resort’s <strong>Party Night</strong>, held at our lively beachfront bar. Feel the sand beneath your feet as you sip on handcrafted cocktails, tropical mocktails, and chilled beverages, all while enjoying a curated selection of <strong>interesting snacks and appetizers</strong> designed to pair perfectly with your drink of choice.</p><p>Live music and ambient lighting set the mood, creating the perfect atmosphere for socializing, dancing, or simply relaxing under the stars. Whether you’re in the mood for laid-back conversations or upbeat island vibes, Party Night is where unforgettable evenings begin.</p><p><strong>Experience Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Signature cocktails, mocktails, and premium drinks</li><li>A variety of gourmet snacks and small bites</li><li>Live music or DJ performances</li><li>Open-air beachfront setting</li><li>Casual yet chic island atmosphere</li></ul><p>Raise your glass and celebrate the night — island style.</p>","images":[],"modular_blocks":[],"tags":["dining","drinking","fun","party"],"locale":"en","uid":"blt607325bcd359064a","ACL":{},"_version":1,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":[{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.021Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1}]},"blt50984eab08c84457":{"title":"Parasailing","taxonomies":[{"taxonomy_uid":"product","term_uid":"parasailing"}],"url":"/pdp/parasailing","product_name":"Parasailing","price":"$249","product":{"data":[{"id":"ac5db3a1-013e-4e41-88d3-f02d2aa27aeb","created_at":"2025-08-06T22:41:07.7488+00:00","url":"parasailing","name":"Parasailing","category":"Activities","locale":"en","image_path":"https://wtxrbukgejhzplfwzamn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/9a490026-f7b9-4f62-8c2e-c35784f4b2fc/112f9136-04dd-4565-9ba7-59ce0c610d57/55309501.jpg","price":"$249 / person","custom_data":{"teaser":"Soar above the Maldives and take in the view with our unforgettable parasailing adventure."},"images":[{"path":"https://wtxrbukgejhzplfwzamn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/9a490026-f7b9-4f62-8c2e-c35784f4b2fc/112f9136-04dd-4565-9ba7-59ce0c610d57/55309501.jpg","ordernum":0}],"sku":"","no_description_text":"texttext"}],"type":"secommerce_product"},"description":"<p>Take your adventure to new heights with Red Panda Resort’s <strong>Parasailing Experience</strong> — an exhilarating way to see the Maldives from a breathtaking new perspective. Lift off from a boat and rise gently into the sky as you're carried by the ocean breeze, with panoramic views of turquoise lagoons, coral reefs, and scattered islands stretching below.</p><p>Whether you're flying solo or side-by-side with a partner, parasailing offers a peaceful, awe-inspiring experience that combines adrenaline with serenity — and memories that stay with you long after you touch back down.</p><p><strong>Experience Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Guided parasailing session with certified crew</li><li>Tandem or solo flight options</li><li>All safety equipment provided</li><li>Boat ride and takeoff from open water</li><li>Complimentary photos upon request</li></ul><p>Feel the thrill. Embrace the view. Float where the sea meets the sky.</p>","images":[],"modular_blocks":[],"tags":["boat","ocean","water","adventure","nature"],"locale":"en","uid":"blt50984eab08c84457","ACL":{},"_version":1,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":[{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.153Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.153Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.153Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.153Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.153Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.153Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.153Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.153Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:16.153Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48",