e turquoise waters of the Maldives with Red Panda Resort’s <strong>Sailing Experience</strong> — a serene yet exhilarating journey across open sea and sunlit skies.</p><p>Whether you’re gliding along calm lagoons or venturing toward distant coral atolls, this experience offers a unique perspective of the islands, untouched and framed by endless ocean. Accompanied by an experienced crew, you'll enjoy the quiet rhythm of the sails, the shimmer of the water, and the possibility of dolphin sightings along the way.</p><p>Perfect for couples, solo travelers, or small groups seeking a moment of peace, beauty, and gentle adventure.</p><p><strong>Experience Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Private or shared sailing session</li><li>Experienced captain and crew</li><li>Light refreshments on board</li><li>Optional snorkeling stop or sunset timing</li><li>Life vests and safety briefing included</li></ul><p>Let the wind guide you — the ocean is calling.</p>","images":[],"modular_blocks":[],"tags":["water","ocean","adventure","sailing","boat"],"locale":"en","uid":"blt89983e8e58c72b7e","ACL":{},"_version":1,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":[{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:17.848Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1}]},"blt1a07d97c26275c40":{"title":"Jet Skiing","taxonomies":[{"taxonomy_uid":"product","term_uid":"jet_skiing"}],"url":"/pdp/jet-skiing","product_name":"Jet Skiing","price":"$199","product":{"data":[{"id":"bf0be423-d769-4734-ab54-fe7f53c61092","created_at":"2025-08-06T22:43:09.51405+00:00","url":"jet_skiing","name":"Jet Skiing","category":"Activities","locale":"en","image_path":"https://wtxrbukgejhzplfwzamn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/9a490026-f7b9-4f62-8c2e-c35784f4b2fc/112f9136-04dd-4565-9ba7-59ce0c610d57/27853489.jpg","price":"$199 / person","custom_data":{"teaser":"Jet ski across crystal waters with speed, style, and a splash of adventure."},"images":[{"path":"https://wtxrbukgejhzplfwzamn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/9a490026-f7b9-4f62-8c2e-c35784f4b2fc/112f9136-04dd-4565-9ba7-59ce0c610d57/27853489.jpg","ordernum":0}],"sku":"","no_description_text":"texttext"}],"type":"secommerce_product"},"description":"<p>Take your adventure to new heights with Red Panda Resort’s <strong>Jet Ski Experience</strong> — an exhilarating way to see the Maldives from a breathtaking new perspective. The clear turquoise water provide a whole new view, and the ocean breeze makes this an unforgettable experience.</p><p>Whether you're jet skiing solo or side-by-side with a partner, parasailing offers a peaceful, awe-inspiring experience that combines adrenaline with serenity — and memories that stay with you long after you touch back down.</p><p><strong>Experience Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Guided jet skiing session with certified trainer</li><li>Tandem or solo options</li><li>All safety equipment provided</li><li>Takeoff from dedicated dock</li><li>Complimentary photos upon request</li></ul><p>Feel the thrill. Embrace the view. Float where the sea meets the sky.</p>","images":[],"modular_blocks":[],"tags":["jet ski","adventure","fun","water","attractions"],"locale":"en","uid":"blt1a07d97c26275c40","ACL":{},"_version":1,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":[{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.050Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1}]},"bltb62a9b7352421c7c":{"title":"Cultural Tour","taxonomies":[],"url":"/pdp/cultural-tour","product_name":"Cultural Tour","price":"$99","product":{"data":[{"id":"ce0cc14d-678b-4c29-b011-af0dbe4ee3c6","created_at":"2025-08-06T22:16:58.527363+00:00","url":"cultural_tour","name":"Cultural Tour","category":"Activities","locale":"en","image_path":"https://wtxrbukgejhzplfwzamn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/9a490026-f7b9-4f62-8c2e-c35784f4b2fc/112f9136-04dd-4565-9ba7-59ce0c610d57/32768925.jpg","price":"$99 / person","custom_data":{"teaser":"Experience the traditions, flavors, and spirit of island life on our guided cultural tour."},"images":[{"path":"https://wtxrbukgejhzplfwzamn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/9a490026-f7b9-4f62-8c2e-c35784f4b2fc/112f9136-04dd-4565-9ba7-59ce0c610d57/32768925.jpg","ordernum":0},{"path":"https://wtxrbukgejhzplfwzamn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/9a490026-f7b9-4f62-8c2e-c35784f4b2fc/112f9136-04dd-4565-9ba7-59ce0c610d57/72798389.jpeg","ordernum":1}],"sku":"","no_description_text":"texttext"}],"type":"secommerce_product"},"description":"<p>Step beyond the shoreline and into the rich heritage of the Maldives with Red Panda Resort’s <strong>Cultural Tour</strong> — an immersive journey through local island life, traditions, and stories passed down through generations.</p><p>Led by knowledgeable local guides, this half-day experience brings you to nearby inhabited islands where you'll explore traditional Maldivian architecture, visit a local mosque, and engage with artisans crafting by hand. Along the way, enjoy authentic island snacks and the opportunity to connect with the people who call these islands home.</p><p>This is more than a tour — it’s a chance to see the Maldives through the eyes of those who live it.</p><p><strong>Experience Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Guided visit to a nearby local island</li><li>Stops at key cultural and historical sites</li><li>Local refreshments and handcrafted souvenirs</li><li>Insightful commentary from your guide</li><li>Boat transfer to and from the resort</li></ul><p>Enrich your stay with a deeper connection to the islands’ living history.</p>","images":[],"modular_blocks":[],"tags":["culture","relaxation","serene","hiking"],"locale":"en","uid":"bltb62a9b7352421c7c","ACL":{},"_version":1,"_in_progress":false,"publish_details":[{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt71a04c285511ff38","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt1c2fdbf023454f09","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"en","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"fr","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"de","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1},{"environment":"blt63159d89af157838","locale":"es","time":"2025-12-10T12:26:18.230Z","user":"blt7e582426ca855a48","version":1}]},"bltec2692166d1eea41":{"title":"Beachfront Dining","taxonomies":[{"taxonomy_uid":"product","term_uid":"beachfront_dining"}],"url":"/pdp/beachfront-dining","product_name":"Beachfront Dining","price":"$129","product":{"data":[{"id":"b7764d8e-f517-4f84-850a-d267764d6fd0","created_at":"2025-08-06T21:54:55.076888+00:00","url":"beachfront_dining","name":"Beachfront Dining","category":"Activities","locale":"en","image_path":"https://wtxrbukgejhzplfwzamn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/9a490026-f7b9-4f62-8c2e-c35784f4b2fc/112f9136-04dd-4565-9ba7-59ce0c610d57/65351683.jpeg","price":"$129 / person","custom_data":{"teaser":"Savor a chef-crafted meal under the stars with your feet in the sand at Red Panda Resort."},"images":[{"path":"https://wtxrbukgejhzplfwzamn.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/9a490026-f7b9-4f62-8c2e-c35784f4b2fc/112f9136-04dd-4565-9ba7-59ce0c610d57/65351683.jpeg","ordernum":0}],"sku":"","no_description_text":"texttext"}],"type":"secommerce_product"},"description":"<p>Dine under the stars with the sound of waves as your soundtrack in Red Panda Resort’s <strong>Beachfront Dining</strong> experience. Set on the soft white sands of our private beach, this exclusive evening combines elevated cuisine with the natural beauty of the Maldives.</p><p>Your table is elegantly arranged just steps from the ocean, illuminated by soft lantern light and framed by a glowing sunset or moonlit sky. Enjoy a multi-course menu prepared by our chef, featuring fresh local seafood, tropical ingredients, and international flavors — all served with attentive, discreet service.</p><p>Ideal for romantic occasions, celebrations, or simply savoring the moment.</p><p><strong>Experience Includes:</strong></p><ul><li>Private table setup on the beach</li><li>Chef-curated multi-course dinner</li><li>Wine or cocktail pairing available</li><li>Personalized service</li><li>Optional musician or firelight upgrade</li></ul><p>A dining